{"id":"vod_md_6348","vodId":"6348","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"刀剑神域2","name_cn":"刀剑神域2","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"24集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231027-1/7cca25a5fb0163fc1ea02d7d87d301b0.jpg"},"summary":"桐人为了调查枪与钢铁的VRMMO「Gun Gale Online」里所发生的“死枪”事件而登陆了该游戏。桐人将自己在ALO里的游戏转移到GGO里后，虽然遇上了乍看之下很容易被误认为是美少女角色的麻烦，但在经过狙击手少女诗乃的引导之后，顺利参加了决定最强枪手的PvP淘汰 赛“BoB”。桐人在这个被枪支配的世界里，成为了唯一使用光剑战斗，并不断在“BoB”里获胜的知名角色。他独特的战斗方式成为了玩家间讨论的焦点，知名度也不断上升。次日，隔天举办的“BoB”正式大赛开始了。在聚集了许多强敌的“多人大混战”中，“死枪”终于现出身影。“死枪”究竟是什么人？“虚拟世界”真的能对“真实世界”产生影响吗？桐人即将独自挑战“死枪”！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-27 13:45:24","classic":true,"classicRank":7,"franchise":"刀剑神域","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231026/fM1nCPvI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231026/M20ptbUS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231026/oLuJY2TU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/XFAsgbTg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/djJUOBHI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/DbokV1pG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/ykwFc6Yd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/qv5UFCJ4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/yUylwmO9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/pqLz7Ilv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/2Wlkewaz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/9DHzWgFT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/u6sby68k/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231027/graNXzaE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://